      <title>2026-07-10 世界杯早报：姆巴佩传射 法国淘汰摩洛哥晋级4强；宽萨被禁赛2场</title>
      <link>https://m.zhibo8.com//news/web/zuqiu/2026-07-10/6a4ff0a9e4c29native.htm</link>
      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/202607080446223592_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/202607080446223592_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/202607080446223592_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-10/match1867449date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进军四强！法国2-0摩洛哥 姆巴佩传射建功+失点登贝莱贴地斩</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260710/zhanbao_image_1867449_1783633103_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260710/zhanbao_image_1867449_1783633103_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260710/zhanbao_image_1867449_1783633103_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span>姆巴佩传射+失点，打进生涯世界杯第20球，登贝莱建功；布努屡扑救难救主；法国将战西班牙/比利时胜者。</span></p><p><strong>【世界杯动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-10/6a4fc234c9a68native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">淘汰摩洛哥！法国连续三届世界杯晋级四强，此前两届一冠一亚</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/6a501c332f08b.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/6a501c332f08b.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/6a501c332f08b.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯8强对阵，法国淘汰摩洛哥，成为首支确定晋级世界杯4强的队伍。法国下一场的对手将是西班牙和比利时之间的胜者，法国下场比赛将在北京时间7月15日03：00打响。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-10/6a4ff15212941native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">继续攀登！27岁姆巴佩打进个人世界杯第20球，暂落后梅西1球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/202607100526464301.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/202607100526464301.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/202607100526464301.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯1/4决赛，姆巴佩在对阵摩洛哥时破门！这是27岁的姆巴佩在世界杯赛场打进的个人第20个进球，他在个人第3届世界杯征程中就打进20球，本届至今6场比赛贡献8球。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-10/6a501e87082cfnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">夯！27岁姆巴佩失点后传射救赎 3届20球+本届6场8球+连续2届8球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/6a5022d1a15ed.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/6a5022d1a15ed.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/6a5022d1a15ed.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">本届世界杯，姆巴佩出战6场比赛已经打进8个进球。这是27岁的姆巴佩生涯中参加的第3届世界杯，至今他在世界杯赛场已经轰出了恐怖的20个进球，超过了本届开赛前克洛泽保持的16球纪录。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-10/6a501b5ba3526native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">法国6场16球！三叉戟姆巴佩8球3助，登贝莱5球2助，奥利塞0球5助</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/6a50252625f21.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/6a50252625f21.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/6a50252625f21.jpg"> </div><p>本届世界杯，姆巴佩8球3助，奥利塞0球5助，登贝莱5球2助，三叉戟引领法国队3场小组打入10球，进入淘汰赛后3场打入6球，总计6场16球。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-10/6a4ffaa2eabc9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">11场12球！姆巴佩世界杯淘汰赛打入12球，刷新自己保持的最佳纪录</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a443b83243d5_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a443b83243d5.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a443b83243d5.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯1/4决赛，法国vs摩洛哥比赛中，姆巴佩打入一球，将自己保持的世界杯淘汰赛进球纪录刷新至12球。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-10/6a501a4fb27d3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">你追我赶！世界杯射手榜：姆巴佩、梅西各8球！姆巴佩3助排名靠前</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.55" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/202607100603063016.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.55" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.55" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/202607100603063016.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/202607100603063016.jpg"> </div><p>本届世界杯射手榜更新：姆巴佩、梅西都是8球。姆巴佩凭借助攻数更多，排名靠前。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-10/6a50197bcd89anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世界杯晋级4强次数：法国8次追平意大利，德国13次巴西11次前二</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.39" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/6a31c27438a3c.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.39" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.39" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/6a31c27438a3c.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/6a31c27438a3c.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯1/4决赛，法国2-0摩洛哥晋级四强。这是法国队连续3届晋级4强，历史第8次晋级四强。在世界杯历史4强次数中，法国追平意大利，并列历史第3位。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-10/6a501b30d0ae1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">失点后一传一射！官方：姆巴佩当选法国2-0摩洛哥全场最佳球员</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/202607100629345286.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/202607100629345286_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/202607100629345286_720.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯1/4决赛，法国2-0淘汰摩洛哥。赛后FIFA官方宣布，姆巴佩当选全场最佳球员。本场他上半场失点后，下半场一传一射。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-10/6a501b1292073native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">非洲10队世界杯全部出局：摩洛哥8强，埃及16强，仅突尼斯未出线</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/202607100605471570_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/202607100605471570_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/202607100605471570_720.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯1/4决赛，摩洛哥0-2不敌法国遭淘汰，非洲球队全部出局。本届世界杯，非洲共10队参加，9队打进32强，2队打进16强，仅摩洛哥进8强。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-10/6a501abe1a3f7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">六英战吕布！8强非洲独苗摩洛哥出局，剩余欧洲6队围剿阿根廷</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/6a501c5eed38d_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/6a501c5eed38d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/6a501c5eed38d.jpg"> </div><p>在摩洛哥出局后，最后一支非洲球队也被淘汰，剩余7支球队中，仅剩阿根廷一支南美洲球队，剩余6支球队都来自欧洲。</p><p><